  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "PRISMA 2020 study flow diagram for LC-aNAATs. 11 studies were included in the previous review; 1776 database records, 871 duplicates removed, 905 screened, 794 excluded, 111 reports assessed and 86 excluded (reasons in supplementary figures); 4 records from public calls were assessed with 1 excluded (inappropriate reference standard). 25 new studies (3 reports) were included, giving 36 studies in total (3 reports).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
